<title>USA: Freddie Mac adjusts discount note rates.</title>
<headline>Freddie Mac adjusts discount note rates.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Freddie Mac</p>
<p>revised short-term discount note rates Wednesday as follows:</p>
<p> -		 MATURITY--RATE</p>
<p> -		Overnight--5.30</p>
<p> -		    Dec 2--5.33</p>
<p> -		    Dec 6--5.25</p>
<p> -		    Dec 9--5.23</p>
<p> -	Dec 13,20,27,31--5.21</p>
<p> -	    Jan 2,14,23--5.19</p>
<p> -	   Feb 26,27,28--5.18</p>
</text>
